{
  "evidenceCount": 10,
  "evidenceSpans": [
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM002-d7d0c2f1",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM002-0002",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法适用于 DEMO-BANK 各级机构办理的全部对公产品的利率与费率定价，包括现金管理、结算、贸易金融、跨境金融、融资与投资银行类产品。",
      "quoteHash": "d7d0c2f145377c274d08738916cfcf9a93643a6bf2351fc5b292e481a940fe76",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2f0760ccf0c600289947be4d7002ffbb0b6c6fdc566ce8753a3901774ba7337f",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-002.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM002-20260922-2f0760cc",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM002-b7b5e509",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM002-0004",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "利率类产品采用\"参考基准 + 加点/减点\"方式定价，参考基准为同期限贷款市场报价利率（LPR）。",
      "quoteHash": "b7b5e5090b12f652f80d6170af32956b9b0656ff7e15f7f1041f5fc3731de228",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2f0760ccf0c600289947be4d7002ffbb0b6c6fdc566ce8753a3901774ba7337f",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-002.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM002-20260922-2f0760cc",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM002-eb0d0f39",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM002-0005",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "流动资金类产品利率下限为同期限 LPR 减 50 个基点，上限为同期限 LPR 加 300 个基点（演示参考值）。",
      "quoteHash": "eb0d0f393f2c43965bdc7e6e99939983d7cf14905080c5a106841813139cbb8a",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2f0760ccf0c600289947be4d7002ffbb0b6c6fdc566ce8753a3901774ba7337f",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-002.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM002-20260922-2f0760cc",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM002-d7f94d6b",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM002-0006",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "费率类产品采用\"标准费率 + 减免\"方式定价；现金管理类服务费年费率参考区间为 0.05% 至 0.30%；结算类业务按笔收取，参考区间为每笔 1 元至 50 元（演示参考值）。",
      "quoteHash": "d7f94d6b5f0befda6e998b067243c1cb433c190791099093d0193a875b983dab",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2f0760ccf0c600289947be4d7002ffbb0b6c6fdc566ce8753a3901774ba7337f",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-002.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM002-20260922-2f0760cc",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM002-a2d6973b",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM002-0008",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "定价在参考区间内的，由一级分行价格管理岗审批；突破参考区间上限或下限的，报总行资产负债管理部审批。",
      "quoteHash": "a2d6973b1816f3e64238834aa70322671b6ecf3f30643b1b5d62d400cb3051ee",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2f0760ccf0c600289947be4d7002ffbb0b6c6fdc566ce8753a3901774ba7337f",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-002.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM002-20260922-2f0760cc",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM002-0ebe9c44",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM002-0009",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "减免幅度不超过标准费率 30% 的，由一级分行审批；超过 30% 且不超过 50% 的，报总行审批；超过 50% 的原则上不予减免，另有总行专项决议的除外。",
      "quoteHash": "0ebe9c44c2614f857ed5bf03e1da0e0899a109af98073790e7830d9025993b5f",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2f0760ccf0c600289947be4d7002ffbb0b6c6fdc566ce8753a3901774ba7337f",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-002.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM002-20260922-2f0760cc",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM002-bf308737",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM002-0010",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "定价审批须完整留痕，记录定价依据、审批人、审批时间与生效日期，并纳入价格台账。",
      "quoteHash": "bf3087376398695191bf0da7b7f43df5003efe8bcb138dcb82e6dcfc16286f55",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2f0760ccf0c600289947be4d7002ffbb0b6c6fdc566ce8753a3901774ba7337f",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-002.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM002-20260922-2f0760cc",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM002-29256ada",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM002-0011",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "属于市场调节价的服务价格项目，应当按照《商业银行服务价格管理办法》关于公示与告知的要求执行，公示口径与实际执行口径一致。",
      "quoteHash": "29256ada7a98db25059e3184bead6d4c1d196e6f11a0d173e68c70268ec97cbd",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2f0760ccf0c600289947be4d7002ffbb0b6c6fdc566ce8753a3901774ba7337f",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-002.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM002-20260922-2f0760cc",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM002-d395fcde",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM002-0012",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "存量客户价格调整应当提前三十个自然日通知客户；合同或协议另有约定的，从其约定。",
      "quoteHash": "d395fcde6267b9924e79fcc016455ab1487ed759d9f7fa0c7a0e479db0adddfb",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2f0760ccf0c600289947be4d7002ffbb0b6c6fdc566ce8753a3901774ba7337f",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-002.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM002-20260922-2f0760cc",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM002-f54e79c5",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM002-0013",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "禁止下列行为：一、以低于成本的价格营销；二、账外收费或将费用拆分为账外项目；三、变相收取未约定的咨询费、顾问费；四、以\"内部价\"\"特殊渠道价\"等表述对客推介。",
      "quoteHash": "f54e79c5e75fdcf1924cc158d9e0a9c20f564ff58317ef42e55dac74d9c82999",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
